s5=item("NEED",3,"A footmuff for cold days","It zips on and stays put, unlike a blanket. Indoors, take hats off, says The Lullaby Trust. In a warm shop or bus, open the footmuff too.",f'<div style="display:flex;gap:30px;align-items:flex-end;margin-left:300px">{img(FG,470)}{img(FB,420)}</div>',"Source for hats: The Lullaby Trust, the UK safer baby sleep charity",("£49.95 · £34.95","Elodie Details, Puggle Monaco"))
s6=item("SKIP",1,"A blanket or muslin over the pram","Don't cover a pram with anything that stops the air flowing. Your baby can overheat, and it's harder to see if they're struggling.",img(FL,520)+'<div style="position:absolute;left:40px;top:170px;background:#051F45;color:#fff;font-weight:800;font-size:30px;padding:14px 22px;border-radius:20px;white-space:nowrap">✕ Nothing over the hood</div>',"Source: The Lullaby Trust, the UK safer baby sleep charity",cross=True)
s7=item("SKIP",2,"Hooks for shopping on the handles","Handles are not for shopping bags: they make a pushchair unstable. Coats and bags piled on top can tip it over too. Use the basket.",img(FL,520)+'<div style="position:absolute;left:40px;top:120px;background:#051F45;color:#fff;font-weight:800;font-size:30px;padding:14px 22px;border-radius:20px;white-space:nowrap">✕ No bags on the handles</div><div style="position:absolute;right:40px;bottom:60px;background:#051F45;color:#fff;font-weight:800;font-size:30px;padding:14px 22px;border-radius:20px;white-space:nowrap">✓ Use the basket</div>',"Source: RoSPA, the UK accident prevention charity",cross=True)
s8=item("SKIP",3,"Pillows, wedges and positioners","Pillows aren't advised for babies under one. And skip anything that holds your baby in one position. The pram mattress should be firm, flat and waterproof.",'<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:22px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:60px"><div class="h" style="font-size:52px;text-decoration:line-through;text-decoration-thickness:6px;opacity:.5">pillows · wedges · nests</div><span class="pill" style="background:#fff;font-size:44px">Firm</span><span class="pill" style="background:#fff;font-size:44px">Flat</span><span class="pill" style="background:#fff;font-size:44px">Waterproof</span></div>',"Source: The Lullaby Trust, the UK safer baby sleep charity",cross=True)
